免费工具正是为您量身打造。只需输入要扫描的计算机名称（或从 Active Directory 或文本文件导入），应用程序即可显示每台计算机本地管理员组的成员——还可选择包含嵌套在管理员组中的域组成员。\n\n功能特点\n- 简单易用、直观的图形界面\n- 批量扫描远程计算机（支持从 Active Directory、文本文件导入或手动输入）\n- 可选包含嵌套在管理员组中的域组成员\n- 支持将结果导出为 CSV 文件或 HTML 文件","tags":["权限","管理员"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://cjwdev.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://cjwdev.com/Software/GetLocalAdminsGUI/VersionHistory.txt","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.10.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/c/Cjwdev/GetLocalAdminsGUI/2.4.0/Cjwdev.GetLocalAdminsGUI.yaml","sha256":"e0e27ddbfafb8540b254b451c9380601a5704016db61a6cca28f848aadb153b8"},{"path":"manifests/c/Cjwdev/GetLocalAdminsGUI/2.4.0/Cjwdev.GetLocalAdminsGUI.installer.yaml","sha256":"e8e4567b8e309d4a90a77bab4cc3e700ceee99045f9b94793e0a4d71449a4c0f"},{"path":"manifests/c/Cjwdev/GetLocalAdminsGUI/2.4.0/Cjwdev.GetLocalAdminsGUI.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"cb2bfa6ebf1f6ee4b28a6c9f6a44dfc671e40ba79373dd408194da75f839ae82"},{"path":"manifests/c/Cjwdev/GetLocalAdminsGUI/2.4.0/Cjwdev.GetLocalAdminsGUI.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"99806d5dff7f94d6e9b50ed1a17333d7981a79dcfc64bacc558926eb3b5d46f2"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"2.4.0"}